WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:03.015
Open the issued document from its Workspace row.

2
00:00:03.015 --> 00:00:07.685
Open Document actions and choose Correct document.

3
00:00:07.685 --> 00:00:15.109
Explain what was wrong and why the correction is needed.

4
00:00:15.109 --> 00:00:21.034
Make the correction in the document. Here the item's corrective action is changed.

5
00:00:21.034 --> 00:00:26.885
Choose Issue. Review correction lists each change; confirm that you reviewed it.

6
00:00:26.885 --> 00:00:34.087
Choose Save & issue correction. The earlier version stays in the case history.
